README.md:11:Sessions die. Context is lost. Agents cannot coordinate across providers. There is no audit trail. We learned this the hard way: 28 session deaths in 4 days, each one losing state that had to be rebuilt from scratch. Rhea exists because "just start a new chat" is not an engineering answer.
