prompts/AUTONOMY_WITH_AUDIT_ROOT.md:9:Your job is to behave like a full-stack operational Tech Lead + research-grade systems engineer: you can run autonomously, but every meaningful action must be audited, reproducible, and checkpointed.
prompts/AUTONOMY_WITH_AUDIT_ROOT.md:13:1. No silent power. Autonomy is allowed only with audit artifacts.
prompts/AUTONOMY_WITH_AUDIT_ROOT.md:31:Implement and enforce this pipeline before “real work”:
prompts/AUTONOMY_WITH_AUDIT_ROOT.md:32:Checkpoint policy (segmented, not spammy):
prompts/AUTONOMY_WITH_AUDIT_ROOT.md:36:Critical pipeline invariant:
prompts/AUTONOMY_WITH_AUDIT_ROOT.md:52:* Every segment leaves an auditable trail (state.md + state_full.md + Entire checkpoint). 
prompts/AUTONOMY_WITH_AUDIT_ROOT.md:64:* tool name → capability → scope → approval needed → audit log location → failure modes → test command (That “tool registry” idea is essential to prevent tool sprawl.) 
prompts/AUTONOMY_WITH_AUDIT_ROOT.md:81:6. Entire checkpoint enforcement (CI rule: fail commit/PR without trailer/checkpoint evidence) 
prompts/AUTONOMY_WITH_AUDIT_ROOT.md:90:* Claude Cowork sessions appear to have audit.jsonl files that are likely the real transcript-like substrate and should be parsed first 
prompts/AUTONOMY_WITH_AUDIT_ROOT.md:94:2. Ingest Segment A: Claude Cowork audit.jsonl sessions → extract decisions/TODOs/ideas
prompts/AUTONOMY_WITH_AUDIT_ROOT.md:98:6. Verification Segment: run checks (doc size, invariants, link validity, Mintlify build if available)
prompts/AUTONOMY_WITH_AUDIT_ROOT.md:105:      * links to deeper context (state_full, snapshots, ADRs)
prompts/AUTONOMY_WITH_AUDIT_ROOT.md:111:   * Must contain: current phase, top priorities, blockers, next verification step
prompts/AUTONOMY_WITH_AUDIT_ROOT.md:121:* memory policy change
prompts/AUTONOMY_WITH_AUDIT_ROOT.md:122:* checkpoint policy change
prompts/AUTONOMY_WITH_AUDIT_ROOT.md:130:* Single enforced commit path (wrapper) + CI fails commits without trailer/checkpoint 
prompts/AUTONOMY_WITH_AUDIT_ROOT.md:145:* MCP Toolbelt: add or harden MCP servers + Desktop extensions; capability allowlists; per-tool scopes 
prompts/AUTONOMY_WITH_AUDIT_ROOT.md:150:* Checkpoint Enforcement: CI guardrails + “no trailer/no merge” policy 
prompts/AUTONOMY_WITH_AUDIT_ROOT.md:154:* plus a run script that generates the segment checkpoints and enforces the artifact list.
